msgid "groupVoiceover/body"
msgstr ""
"Assign all four voiced event crew members (%(crew_members_names)s) to any vehicle in your Garage (one of them must be the commander) to activate dynamic team conversations during battle.\n"
"In vehicles with five or six roles, the remaining roles can be filled by any other crew members."

msgid "groupVoiceover/header"
msgstr "Dynamic team conversations"

