msgid "keys/body"
msgstr ""
"A unique currency used to progress through the Babylon: Dark Tower event and"
" receive valuable items, including the main event reward. Can be earned in "
"event battles and purchased in bundles. Destroy enemy vehicles in Babylon: "
"Dark Tower to collect as much matter as possible and earn Keys."

msgid "keys/boss"
msgstr "• Boss defeated:"

msgid "keys/bottom"
msgstr "At the end of the event (%(date)s), all unused Keys will be removed."

msgid "keys/bundles"
msgstr "• Purchase in event bundles"

msgid "keys/daily"
msgstr "• Daily vehicle mission:"

msgid "keys/effective"
msgstr "• Efficiency in battle:"

msgid "keys/gold"
msgstr "• Purchase for gold"

msgid "keys/header"
msgstr "Decryption Keys"

msgid "keys/howToEarn"
msgstr "How to Earn"

msgid "keys/howToUse"
msgstr "How to Use"

msgid "keys/howToUseDescr"
msgstr ""
"Use Keys to decrypt Records, unlock new Objectives, and progress to the main"
" event reward. You can also spend Keys to skip Objectives and reach the "
"rewards sooner."

msgid "keys/inStock"
msgstr "available"

msgid "keys/secret"
msgstr "• Secret reward:"

